        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"634338\">Michael Rothgang</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Stuck.20on.20proof.3A.20derivs.20of.20compoenets.20of.20euclideanSpace.20func/near/579230158\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What's the mathematical proof you'd give?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I think I will say that the derivative of a component function of a differentiable vector function is the component of the derivative of the vector valued function.</p>",
