        "content": "<p>found <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=fderiv_comp_deriv#doc\">docs#fderiv_comp_deriv</a> and <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=ContinuousLinearMap.fderiv#doc\">docs#ContinuousLinearMap.fderiv</a>, which should be usable here</p>",
